STRATEGY

The following steps are part of larger strategy which would include working with the railroads,
prioritizing and funding local projects, building political support, working with the local business
community, etc. Steps would also include:


Work with DDA on expanding its boundary to include the entire Reed Avenue corridor

Through City / MPO / DDA efforts, pursue additional grant funding as identified by Ayres and
Associates, October 1, 2016.  Sources include (as identified)

